&lt;p&gt;Stripe is building the economic infrastructure for the internet. Millions of businesses use Stripe to accept payments, manage revenue, and grow globally. Stripe Tax helps businesses calculate, collect, and manage indirect taxes as they sell across products, markets, and business models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring a Staff Product Manager to help shape the future of Stripe Tax. In this role, you will lead high-impact product strategy and execution across a broad portfolio, making it easier for businesses to understand, calculate, collect, and manage tax as they grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Product Manager on Stripe Tax, you will identify the most important opportunities to improve our tax products and turn them into focused strategies, durable platforms, and exceptional user experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with Engineering, Design, Tax, Partnerships, Go-to-Market, and other product teams to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set strategy and lead product initiatives that help more businesses successfully adopt and use Stripe Tax.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the speed, accuracy, reliability, and usability of Stripe Tax calculations and related workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expand support for the geographies, tax requirements, industries, products, and business models that matter most to Stripe users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build capabilities for complex tax needs, such as registrations, exemptions, address and fulfillment logic, tax customization, and other business-specific requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop scalable products and platform capabilities that work across Stripe’s ecosystem, including integrations, connector apps, marketplaces, and Connect platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner across Stripe to create coherent end-to-end experiences spanning calculation, collection, reporting, and tax management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use customer insight, market context, data, and technical understanding to prioritize investments and make clear tradeoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align senior stakeholders and cross-functional partners around a shared product direction, measurable outcomes, and an execution plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will help make Stripe Tax a product businesses can rely on as they scale. Merchants should be able to confidently answer “yes” to questions such as:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can I use Stripe Tax for my business and the locations where I sell?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Does Stripe Tax support the taxes and business models that apply to me?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can it calculate tax accurately for my registrations, exemptions, customers, products, and fulfillment model?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is it fast, reliable, and easy for my team to operate?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Does it work with the other Stripe products, platforms, and integrations my business depends on?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are a product leader who is comfortable operating in ambiguous, high-stakes spaces where customer needs, regulatory complexity, technical constraints, and commercial opportunity intersect. You can translate a broad mission into a focused strategy, build alignment across teams, and deliver meaningful products over multiple horizons.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You likely have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant product management experience, including ownership of complex, platform-oriented, or technically deep products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of setting strategy and delivering multi-team initiatives with measurable business and customer impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong judgment in prioritizing across customer needs, market opportunities, operational complexity, and engineering investment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working closely with engineering and design partners to build reliable, scalable products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to communicate clearly with executive stakeholders and to align diverse partners around a shared direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity about global commerce, financial infrastructure, tax, compliance, payments, marketplaces, or developer platforms. Direct domain experience is helpful but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A customer-first mindset and the ability to turn complex requirements into simple, effective product experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tax is a fundamental challenge for businesses that sell across borders, channels, and business models. Stripe Tax has the opportunity to remove that complexity, helping businesses launch faster, expand with confidence, and operate globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-leverage role at the intersection of global commerce, financial infrastructure, and product platform strategy. You will shape how Stripe Tax evolves to serve the next generation of internet businesses.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is an open-core software company that develops the &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/platform/&quot;&gt;intelligent orchestration platform&lt;/a&gt; for DevSecOps, used by more than 100,000 organizations and 50 million people. Our mission is to unlock every team to ship trusted software at the speed of imagination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Software is increasingly built by machines and directed by people. When agentic coding tools accelerate without context, governance, and lifecycle control, teams get speed with chaos. GitLab enables speed with control: customers deploy agents across the software development lifecycle (SDLC) with the orchestration, context, security, and governance to ship trusted software at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles show up in how we work. We build a culture of excellence around Speed with Quality, Ownership Mindset, and Customer Outcomes, and we treat AI as a core productivity multiplier. Every team member is expected to put AI into daily workflows to move faster without losing control. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Principal Program Manager, Go-To-Market, you own two equal pillars of go-to-market execution for Product &amp;amp; Technical Marketing (PTM). First, you are the strategic and hands-on architect behind GitLab&#39;s high-stakes minor and major launches, redesigning the launch operating model with AI agents at its core so customers discover, adopt, and experience GitLab with precision.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Second, you run program management on key initiatives that span Product Management and Product Design through Growth Marketing, Comms and Social, and Field Enablement, wherever those motions depend on PTM. PTM team&amp;nbsp; is responsible for product and solutions marketing, technical writing and documentation, developer advocacy, and globalization, and acts as the glue between these functions across a variety of go-to-market initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are AI-first by default. When programs still run on many manual steps, you convert that work into team-wide AI workflows, either by shipping the automations yourself or by partnering with the AI Transformation Owner (ATO) for the marketing organization to drive shared skills, adoption, and governance. You are not a reactive deadline chaser. You drive solutions with stakeholders as dates approach, design decision stages so tradeoffs land early, and redesign stages and workflows when product roadmap, growth priorities, or major launch decisions change. You create clarity in ambiguity: frame the problem, present options and tradeoffs, name owners, and optimize for decision velocity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In your first year, you institutionalize a dual operating system: a scalable launch framework for 15+ minor and major launches per year, and a portfolio program practice that maps dependencies from Product and Design through PTM into Growth, Comms, and Field. You ship production agent workflows that cut manual coordination, establish benchmarks for quality, and make go-to-market program management achieve relevance in the AI era, and become a trusted partner across the organization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the VP of Product &amp;amp; Technical Marketing, you operate with significant executive visibility and autonomy. You measure success by what lands for customers and the business: pipeline where it matters, and brand and community impact where business requires it, not by activity volume alone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Some examples of projects:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate minor launches that put new platform releases in front of the community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate major launches tied to company events that move pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate weekly signal announcements so we stay present in a fast-moving ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sequence product decisions into PTM and other go-to-market functions, with clear handoffs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep field enablement on track when they depend on messaging and sales assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design decision points early so blockers show up before the deadline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scope launches for pipeline and for post-launch adoption when agentic products are involved&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build AI workflows that draft briefs, synthesize status, and cut manual program steps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rebuild stages and calendars when roadmap, growth priorities, or launch plans change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run retrospectives that improve the system, and remove process as often as you add it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run a concurrent portfolio of PTM-dependent initiatives with clear owners, dates, and tradeoffs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Give leadership the context to decide: risks, options, and a recommendation, not status theater&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align go-to-market functions when work streams collide or compete for the same people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Codify how programs run so each cycle starts sharper than the last&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Put quality in the path of the work, then confirm market-facing pieces landed as intended&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn recurring coordination into shared AI workflows the team can run without you in the loop&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Marketing&#39;s ATO when a workflow needs department-wide adoption or guardrails&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate early with a clear ask when a call sits above the working team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Protect focus with smaller core teams, fewer standing meetings, more working sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close the loop on results with the data team, then feed what you learn into the next cycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Program management for go-to-market across the high-tech industry, with first-hand experience with complex, multi-stakeholder and cross-functional initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and scaling how programs run in large, distributed orgs, with clear results&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on work with AI agents and automations that real teams used in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of turning manual work into AI workflows and helping others adopt them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort standing up launch and program frameworks without adding busywork&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong grasp of how product releases and how they impact go-to-market teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bias to action for priorities: defining risks and clear options for path forward&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Habit of measuring success by pipeline, adoption, or consumption, not activity counts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to run several high-stakes workstreams at once without dropping quality or trust&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear writing and speaking with executives; gets decisions made across competing priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence without direct authority, including with senior leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with project tools with AI automation on top, and the ability to use GitLab&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel if needed and comply with the company&#39;s travel policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Product &amp;amp; Technical Marketing at GitLab is the engine behind how GitLab positions, launches, documents, and evangelizes its value proposition for enterprises worldwide. We connect GitLab&#39;s product capabilities to customers and prospects across technical personas and executive buyers, and we partner closely with Product Management, Product Design, Growth Marketing, Comms and Social, Field Enablement, Sales, and the broader go-to-market organization so what we build lands in market with clarity, impact, and relevance. We operate as one marketing organization with clear roles: PTM carries the message; Growth activates demand; Comms amplifies narrative; work moves when handoffs are explicit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You serve as the senior operational and program spine inside Product &amp;amp; Technical Marketing. You translate roadmap and positioning strategy into coordinated launches and PTM-dependent initiatives across the go-to-market chain, while building the playbooks and AI-powered workflows that make excellence repeatable at scale. We are building towards an operational model where agents handle the scaffolding of cross-functional programs, freeing team members to focus on strategy and judgement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The base salary range for this role’s listed level is currently for residents of the&amp;nbsp;United States only. This range is intended to reflect the role&#39;s base salary rate in locations throughout the US.&amp;nbsp;Grade level and salary ranges are determined through interviews and a review of education, experience, knowledge, skills, abilities of the applicant, equity with other team members, alignment with market data,&amp;nbsp;and geographic location.&amp;nbsp;The base salary range does not include any bonuses, equity, or benefits. See more information on our &lt;a class=&quot;waffle-rich-text-link&quot; href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-link=&quot;https://bit.ly/GLBeneUS&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#1155cc;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:underline;font-family:&#39;&#39;Arial&#39;&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt;benefits&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;font-family:&#39;Arial&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;waffle-rich-text-link&quot; href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/stock-options/&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-link=&quot;https://bit.ly/GLequity&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#1155cc;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:underline;font-family:&#39;&#39;Arial&#39;&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt;equity&lt;/a&gt;. Sales roles are also eligible for incentive pay targeted at up to 100% of the offered base salary.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;United States Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$203,200&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$345,600 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#flexible-paid-time-off-pto&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/inclusion/tmrg-tmag/&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your wellbeing, our mission. Join a company shaping a healthier world.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GET TO KNOW US&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Wellhub we&#39;re revolutionizing workplace wellness. Our platform connects employees worldwide to the best partners for fitness, mindfulness, therapy, nutrition, and sleep—all in one simple subscription. Headquartered in NYC with team members in Europe, North America and South America, we’re on a mission to make every company a wellness company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe work should be fulfilling, inspiring, and balanced. Here, you’ll find a team that values wellbeing, collaboration, and different perspectives, where passion and creativity push boundaries to create real impact. Your contributions will help shape a healthier, more balanced world for you and millions of people globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us in redefining the future of wellbeing!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are hiring a &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;33,1,0,0&quot;&gt;GTM Program Manager&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;in our &lt;strong&gt;New Markets &lt;/strong&gt;area in &lt;strong&gt;Brazil&lt;/strong&gt;! This is a&lt;strong&gt; Remote – Brazil &lt;/strong&gt;position, meaning you can work from anywhere within the country. Please note that this role is only open to candidates in Brazil.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will sit at the strategic intersection of Demand Generation, Revenue Operations, Marketing, and Technical teams. As an operational amplifier for our commercial organization, you will design, build, and optimize AI-powered automations, automated workflows, and data pipelines that power our outbound go-to-market motions and help Wellhub scale globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR IMPACT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automate GTM Infrastructure:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and deploy AI-powered data enrichment systems and workflows (using tools like Clay, Zapier, n8n, Salesforce, and Salesloft) to identify Ideal Customer Profile (ICP) prospects and deliver high-intent leads directly to sales teams. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Commercial Personalization: &lt;/strong&gt;Build workflows that automate highly personalized messaging and deliver actionable account intelligence to SDRs and Closers to increase conversion rates. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execute GTM Experiments: &lt;/strong&gt;Drive, prioritize, and analyze A/B experiments and outbound pilots to accelerate regional pipeline generation and remove operational bottlenecks. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act as Internal Operational Expert: &lt;/strong&gt;Serve as the subject matter expert and day-to-day operator for Clay, Salesloft, and Salesforce across your designated region. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Orchestration: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner closely with Global Strategy, Sales Dev Directors, Marketing, and Revenue Ops leaders to track funnel performance, synthesize feedback loops, and influence regional commercial strategy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Live the mission:&lt;/strong&gt; inspire and empower others by genuinely caring for your own wellbeing and your colleagues. Bring wellbeing to the forefront of work, and create a supportive environment where everyone feels comfortable taking care of themselves, taking time off, and finding work-life wellness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO YOU ARE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent written and verbal communication skills in English, with proven ability to influence cross-functional stakeholders across international teams. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Curiosity &amp;amp; Vibe Coding: &lt;/strong&gt;Passionate about learning new tools, experimenting with AI tools (like Claude, Cursor, or AI Agents), and tinkering with automation platforms. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relevant Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Proven track record in Revenue Operations, Sales Operations, Marketing Operations, Technical Product Management, or Project Management managing complex, multi-stakeholder initiatives. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems &amp;amp; Tooling Familiarity: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience building workflows and automations using CRMs (Salesforce, HubSpot), sales engagement tools (Salesloft, Apollo), or orchestration platforms (Clay, n8n, Zapier, Make). &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Bias &amp;amp; ROI Mindset: &lt;/strong&gt;Relentlessly focused on practical outcomes—always asking &quot;how will this workflow help an SDR validate more opportunities or close more deals?&quot; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experimental &amp;amp; Analytical: &lt;/strong&gt;Comfortable testing hypotheses, analyzing data (SQL/Excel), validating signals, and navigating ambiguous requirements into structured, scalable processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We recognize that individuals approach job applications differently. We strongly encourage all aspiring applicants to go for it, even if they don&#39;t match the job description 100%. We welcome your application and will be delighted to explore if you could be a great fit for our team. For this specific role, please note that AI Tools expertise and Fluent English are mandatory requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER YOU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With thoughtful benefits, emotional wellbeing resources, and a culture that empowers you to take ownership of your role and your wellbeing, we create an environment where you can thrive in all dimensions of your life.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our flexible benefits program allows you to customize some of the benefits, according to your needs!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WELLHUB:&lt;/strong&gt; Free Gold+ membership with access to onsite gyms and studios, digital fitness programs, and online wellness resources for meditation, nutrition, mental wellbeing support, and more! Add up to three family members to your plan, ensuring access to wellness for those who matter most to you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WELLZ:&lt;/strong&gt; A complete emotional wellbeing program with a unique approach. It offers personalized journeys that combine individual therapy sessions (52 per year) and on-demand content.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HEALTHCARE:&lt;/strong&gt; Health, dental, and life insurance.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FLEXIBLE WORK:&lt;/strong&gt; As a Flexible First company, we offer hybrid and remote options to give you the freedom to work in a way that suits you. The model for this specific role can be discussed with your recruiter and hiring manager. When you join, use our home office reimbursement to set up your home office.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FLEXIBLE SCHEDULE: &lt;/strong&gt;Flexibility for us isn’t just about where we work—it also means being able to shape how and when we get things done. Together with their leaders, employees define schedules that align with their time zones, team needs, and personal routines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PAID TIME OFF:&lt;/strong&gt; It’s important to take time away from work to recharge.Employees receive vacations after 6 months and additional 3 days off per year + 1 day off for each year of tenure (up to 5 additional days) + an extra holiday for your birthday!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PAID PARENTAL LEAVE:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Welcoming a new child is one of the most special moments in your life. Take the time to be present and enjoy your growing family. We offer 100% paid parental leave to all new parents. Parents giving birth are eligible for an extended leave and a ramp-back period to return part-time while they get settled.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CAREER GROWTH:&lt;/strong&gt; Access world-class platforms, participate in interactive sessions,&amp;nbsp; build your personalized development roadmap, and explore internal opportunities. We focus on continuous learning and feedback to support your journey toward personal and professional success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CULTURE:&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll join a team of passionate people who come together to break boundaries, support each other, and create a meaningful impact in workplace wellness. We win together, building trust through open communication and a culture where every perspective matters. &lt;a href=&quot;https://wellhub.com/en-us/careers/our-values/&quot;&gt;Learn more about our shared culture and values here.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And to get a glimpse of life at Wellhub… Follow us on &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/lifeatwellhub/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Instagram&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt; @lifeatwellhub&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;and &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/wellhub/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity, and Belonging at Wellhub&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a collaborative, supportive, and inclusive space where everyone knows they belong.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wellhub is committed to creating a diverse work environment and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, religion, color, sex, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, age, non-disqualifying physical or mental disability, national origin, veteran status, or any other basis covered by appropriate law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to inclusion also extends to how we recognize and reward our people. We’re proud to be Syndio Fair Pay Certified, reflecting our ongoing dedication to equitable and fair pay practices across our global team. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/posts/wellhub_fairpay-syndio-activity-7407826561531363328-wbN_?utm_source=share&amp;amp;utm_medium=member_desktop&amp;amp;rcm=ACoAAAzHQWABKsRqcpvxy4QpDCJNe_szRdC4hgY&quot;&gt;Read more about it here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
